-- The expression after AFTER is a duration (a NUMBER) or an instant (a
-- DATE); a STRING is neither, and the refusal names both
-- (EVERY-EACH-QUANTIFIER-SPEC §5.1.2).

DECLARE Actor IS ONE OF
    Buyer
    Seller

DECLARE Action IS ONE OF
    Pay
    Deliver

GIVETH A DEONTIC Actor Action
bad MEANS PARTY Buyer MUST Pay AFTER "next Tuesday" WITHIN 5
